          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sasa, watenge Walawi wote kuwa wangu badala ya wazaliwa wa kwanza wa Waisraeli. Kadhalika, watenge ng'ombe wa Walawi wote badala ya wazaliwa wa kwanza wa ng'ombe wa Waisraeli. Mimi ndimi Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa ajili ya fidia ya wazaliwa wa kwanza wa kiume wa watu wa Israeli 273, wanaozidi idadi ya wanaume Walawi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "utapokea kwa kila mwanamume fedha shekeli tano, kulingana na kipimo cha mahali patakatifu, ambayo ni sawa na gera ishirini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na fedha hizo kwa ajili ya fidia ya hao waliozidi idadi yao utampa Aroni na wanawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose akatii, akachukua fedha hizo za fidia ya hao waliozidi idadi ya waliofidiwa na Walawi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alipokea kutoka wazaliwa wa kwanza wa Waisraeli fedha kiasi cha shekeli 1,365, kulingana na kipimo cha mahali patakatifu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akawapa Aroni na wanawe fedha hizo za fidia sawa na neno la Mwenyezi-Mungu kama alivyomwamuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.51"
            ]
          }
